250	// CLI: `node converge-wiring.mjs [owner/repo] [--badges]` — converge THIS repo's
251	// wiring. The full name comes from argv or GITHUB_REPOSITORY/CLAUDINITE_REPO; the
252	// scheduler stub from the vendored mount. This is the single surface bootstrap
253	// (Part 6) and baselining both invoke, so the wiring set is defined once, here —
