82	// Note selection moved to the version gate (#768 Phase 4): a note is pending while
83	// its record is in this repo's gap, decided by `migrationApplies` in the engine —
84	// the one predicate that also decides what a mount fetches and what a check
85	// tolerates. The date-window selector that lived here is gone with the hold below;
86	// nothing can now disagree about whether a record still applies.
