88	// The stamp is no longer HELD for a pending note (#768 Phase 4). Holding it kept a
89	// note selected across runs while the date decided selection; version-ranged
90	// selection needs no such trick, because a record leaves the gap only when the
91	// version carrying its change is installed. Removing the hold is what makes
